{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "es2022",
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "strict": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "allowJs": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["./src/*"]
    },
    "types": ["node"],
    "lib": ["es2022", "dom", "dom.iterable"]
  },
  "_comment_paths": "沿用上游的 `@/…` 匯入路徑,讓移植檔案逐字不改、日後對照 apt-patched diff 最小。vitest.config.mts 的 alias 必須與這裡一致。",
  "_comment_include_test": "測試檔一起檢查(上游教訓:vitest 用 esbuild 轉譯、型別直接丟掉,測試裡的型別錯誤跑測試時完全看不到)。",
  "include": [
    "src/**/*.ts",
    "test/**/*.ts"
  ]
}
